  "text": "Great, thanks. Well, thank you for that. I really appreciate you guys also taking the time to meet with me on short notice. You guys probably have a very busy schedule with all the stuff that you're trying to do. So a quick background. Venkat Gulapalli. I am a pediatrician by training, only practiced for a couple years, but had been in the healthcare marketing space for the last 20 plus years. Of the last 15 or 16 or so, have been really around data, customer data, and when I say customer, really around the HCP, some patient, but really around the customer data and creating unique data products and platforms and ecosystems that essentially support brands. Specifically in the last four or five years it's been centered around rare disease. And then also I have a bit of a, just a zigzag."
