  "text": "It was going to fuel everything that were going to do for future engagements, certainly educating of us, of course, but more importantly, it was going to fuel what were going to do with our, basically our medical affairs group that would be engaging a lot of these key opinion leaders. But this isn't too far removed because I think when were there, Bob. Right. And Doug, they shared with us what, 120 potential sites of where these patients were accessing care. And part of the reason were there were a certain level of a multidisciplinary team that were involved, dependent upon the level of severity of the disease. So this, to me is spot on. I think it might also be helpful."
